<title>CHILE: Chilgener reports lower nine-month net.</title>
<headline>Chilgener reports lower nine-month net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilgener SA reported the following earnings for the first three quarters of the year.</p>
<p>				To Q3 1996	  To Q3 1995</p>
<p> Total revenues		  102.9		92.3</p>
<p> Operating income		 30.6		27.1</p>
<p> Non-operating income	    3.2		13.0</p>
<p> Net earnings		     32.7		40.6</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom *56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
